Delif's Cone
Ornithopter
Giant Growth
Forest x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Delif's Cone.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Delif's Cone.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
